# STEP-01 - fhc2 environment audit

Status --> Planned

## Objective

Read-only inventory of the existing fhc2 environment before installing anything.

Expected checks include:
- operating system
- Python
- FFmpeg / ffprobe
- Piper installation and current voice model
- Git / GitHub CLI
- available filesystem space
- relevant existing Mini-Kuzai paths
- fonts usable by the renderer

No package installation or configuration change is authorized by this step.

## Exit criteria

A sanitized GOGIT report is published and reviewed before STEP-02 begins.
